Case 2: VARCHAR > SOME a CHAR column becomes a join with a derived table of the MIN     

===================================================
c1    
b     

Query plan:
sscan
    class: t? node[?]
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
(select distinct min( cast(t?.c? as varchar(?))) from t? t?)
Query plan:
temp(order by)
    subplan: nl-join (inner join)
                 edge:  term[?]
                 outer: sscan
                            class: t? node[?]
                            cost:  ? card ?
                 inner: sscan
                            class: av? node[?]
                            sargs: term[?]
                            cost:  ? card ?
                 cost:  ? card ?
    sort:  ? asc
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select t?.c? from t? t?, (select distinct min( cast(t?.c? as varchar(?))) from t? t?) av? (av_?) where (t?.c?>av?.av_?) order by ?
